# Documentation Sync

- When code changes affect behavior documented in `docs/README.md`, `frontend/src/README.md`, or other docs, update the docs in the same change
- When adding new env vars, update `backend/.env.example` and `environment.d.ts`
- When a doc is found to be stale or contradictory, fix it immediately rather than leaving it for later
